    "detailed_description": "<strong>Overview</strong><br>Command your army against a relentless demon horde in this intense real-time strategy game. Master strategy and resource management to conquer the enemy's stronghold while defending your own in the ultimate battle for survival. As you progress through the game, you'll unlock new troops, each with unique abilities and strengths. Refine your strategy by leveraging your troops' strengths to exploit your enemy's weaknesses. Experiment with different unit compositions and tactics to discover the most effective ways to conquer the enemy. As you adapt and evolve your strategy, you'll find new and exciting ways to outwit your foes and claim victory in the heat of battle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595850/extras/85c5558615d3d68e75c91e643df4d2ab.poster.avif?t=1725734334\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595850/extras/85c5558615d3d68e75c91e643df4d2ab.webm?t=1725734334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595850/extras/85c5558615d3d68e75c91e643df4d2ab.mp4?t=1725734334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Game Modes</strong><br>Choose your path to victory by playing in Siege Mode or Blitz Mode. In Siege Mode, begin with basic troops and gradually unlock more powerful units as you survive waves of increasingly challenging enemies. Test your endurance and strategic prowess as you build your forces from the ground up. In Blitz Mode, start with all troops at your disposal and race against time to conquer the enemy castle as quickly as possible, making split-second decisions to outmaneuver your opponents.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595850/extras/d36eaed347652859b3d58d1ee992c4ae.poster.avif?t=1725734334\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595850/extras/d36eaed347652859b3d58d1ee992c4ae.webm?t=1725734334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595850/extras/d36eaed347652859b3d58d1ee992c4ae.mp4?t=1725734334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Whether you prefer to manage the battle from a commanding view above the battlefield or dive into the heart of the action in third-person mode, Stronghold Siege offers an immersive experience that puts you in full control of your army's destiny. Lead your forces, devise cunning strategies, and claim victory in a world where every decision could be the difference between triumph and defeat.",
